      fmt(rise) + ', so m = ' + fmt(rise) + '/' + fmt(L.stair.run) + ' = ' + fmt(L.m) + '. ' +
      'It cuts the y-axis at b = ' + fmt(L.b) + '. Those two facts alone give the equation ' + eqStr(L.m, L.b) + '. ' +
